WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:05.144
Every day, thousands of students arrive on campus looking for a place to

00:05.204 --> 00:08.013
stay, a ride to class, books, food and services.

00:08.073 --> 00:11.241
Arounus brings all of it together, around your campus.

00:11.301 --> 00:13.752
And it's where your business can be found.

00:15.612 --> 00:18.960
Arounus is a campus marketplace and learning platform.

00:19.020 --> 00:22.432
Students browse real listings by university or college:

00:22.492 --> 00:25.777
rooms, transport, items for sale, and other services.

00:25.837 --> 00:29.880
One platform, one community, one place where campus life happens.

00:31.740 --> 00:34.685
As a business, you can advertise three things.

00:34.745 --> 00:37.494
Rooms and accommodation, with monthly rent,

00:37.554 --> 00:42.459
area, room type and photos. Services, from campus shuttles and deliveries to

00:42.519 --> 00:45.595
tutoring, food, beauty and events. And products,

00:45.655 --> 00:49.776
from textbooks and laptops to furniture and everyday essentials.

00:51.636 --> 00:55.817
Getting started is simple. Open the market and choose Sell or list.

00:55.877 --> 00:58.665
Create one advertiser account with your name,

00:58.725 --> 01:01.829
business name, contact number, email and password.

01:01.889 --> 01:04.677
That single account manages every room, ride,

01:04.737 --> 01:06.576
service and product you offer.

01:08.436 --> 01:11.305
Then choose what you want to list. For a room,

01:11.365 --> 01:14.489
add the title, nearest campus, area, monthly rent,

01:14.549 --> 01:17.927
room type, a clear description and up to three photos.

01:17.987 --> 01:20.856
You can attach your exact location in one tap.

01:20.916 --> 01:24.358
For a product, ride or service, add your business name,

01:24.418 --> 01:27.096
category, price, stock and contact details.

01:28.956 --> 01:32.419
Now publish. Products and services go live immediately.

01:32.479 --> 01:35.622
Rooms are reviewed by an admin before they appear,

01:35.682 --> 01:38.376
so students only see trusted accommodation.

01:40.236 --> 01:43.388
From your advertiser dashboard you can edit any listing,

01:43.448 --> 01:46.830
mark a room as filled, pause a product, update availability,

01:46.890 --> 01:49.584
and reply to student messages, all in one place.

01:51.444 --> 01:55.275
And this is what students see. Your listing appears as a card with

01:55.335 --> 01:57.809
your photo, title, price and business name,

01:57.869 --> 02:00.285
with a verified badge when you're trusted,

02:00.345 --> 02:03.232
and sponsored placement when you want extra reach.

02:03.292 --> 02:05.708
Students open it to view the full gallery,

02:05.768 --> 02:08.773
description, availability, and contact you directly.

02:08.833 --> 02:11.544
They can save it, share it, and get directions.

02:13.404 --> 02:17.154
Whether you rent rooms, run a shuttle, sell products or offer a service,

02:17.214 --> 02:20.859
Arounus connects you with the campus community right on your doorstep.

02:20.919 --> 02:23.822
Create your advertiser account today at arounus dot com.

02:23.882 --> 02:25.992
Sell or list, and be found around campus.
